msgstr "One <span class='mono'>suffix&nbsp;upstream</span> per line. The matching domain (and all its subdomains) is <b>always</b> resolved via that upstream — even when 'Use our own core' is on. For local/private zones (e.g. <span class='mono'>*.home.arpa → 192.168.1.1</span>). The longest matching suffix wins."

