msgstr "Resolves the host name of <b>named</b> encrypted upstreams like <span class='mono'>tls://dns.google</span> / <span class='mono'>https://cloudflare-dns.com/…</span> using this plain-DNS IP (connects to the IP; TLS is still verified against the host name). If empty, the system DNS is used. Doesn't affect plain-IP upstreams."

