msgstr "when changed — due to Docker — on the server"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/servers.html:51
msgid "çalıştırman gerekir (konteyner yeniden oluşturulur). Tüm bu ayarlar"
msgstr "you must run (the container is recreated). All these settings"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/servers.html:51
msgid "dosyasında tutulur (DB'de değil)."
msgstr "are stored in the file (not in the DB)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:3
#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:7
msgid "Genel Ayarlar"
msgstr "General Settings"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:8
msgid "Geçmiş, önbellek ve erişim davranışı. Çözümleme (upstream / recursion / strateji) artık ayrı <b>Sorgu Ayarları</b> sayfasında. Değişiklikler resolver'a ~10 sn içinde yansır (yeniden başlatma yok)."
msgstr "History, cache and access behavior. Resolution (upstream / recursion / strategy) is now on the separate <b>Query Settings</b> page. Changes reach the resolver within ~10 s (no restart)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:23
msgid "Kapalıyken sorgular veritabanına yazılmaz — Genel Bakış / Sorgu Geçmişi / Analiz beslenmez (çözümleme çalışmaya devam eder)."
msgstr "When off, queries aren't written to the database — Overview / Query History / Analytics aren't fed (resolution keeps working)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:29
msgid "Önbellek"
msgstr "Cache"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:30
msgid "Kapalıyken her sorgu baştan çözülür (yavaş ama taze). Açıkken cevaplar TTL süresince bellekte tutulur."
msgstr "When off, every query is resolved from scratch (slow but fresh). When on, answers are kept in memory for their TTL."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:35
msgid "Min TTL (sn)"
msgstr "Min TTL (s)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:36
msgid "Max TTL (sn)"
msgstr "Max TTL (s)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:38
msgid "Min TTL kısa süreli kayıtları en az bu kadar bellekte tutar (0 = dokunma); Max TTL üst sınırdır."
msgstr "Min TTL keeps short-lived records in memory at least this long (0 = leave alone); Max TTL is the upper cap."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:45
msgid "Geçmiş saklama süresi"
msgstr "History retention"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:46
msgid "Bu süreden eski sorgu geçmişi otomatik silinir (saatlik kontrol). 'Kapalı' = sonsuz."
msgstr "Query history older than this is deleted automatically (checked hourly). 'Off' = forever."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:49
msgid "Kapalı"
msgstr "Off"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:51
msgid "Özel…"
msgstr "Custom…"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:54
msgid "Özel gün (yalnız 'Özel…' seçiliyken)"
msgstr "Custom days (only when 'Custom…' is selected)"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:55
msgid "ör. 45"
msgstr "e.g. 45"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:65
msgid "Önbelleği temizle"
msgstr "Clear cache"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:66
msgid "Bellekteki tüm çözümleme önbelleğini boşaltır (sonraki sorgular baştan çözülür)."
msgstr "Empties the entire in-memory resolution cache (subsequent queries resolve from scratch)."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:72
msgid "Geçmişi temizle"
msgstr "Clear history"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:73
msgid "Veritabanındaki tüm sorgu geçmişini siler — <b>geri alınamaz</b>."
msgstr "Deletes all query history in the database — <b>irreversible</b>."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:75
msgid "Tüm sorgu geçmişi silinsin mi? Bu işlem geri alınamaz."
msgstr "Delete all query history? This cannot be undone."

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:75
msgid "Geçmişi sil"
msgstr "Delete history"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:82
msgid "Ayarları yedekle"
msgstr "Back up settings"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:83
msgid "Tüm ayarlar + engel/izin listeleri + hazır listeler + rewrite + zamanlama'yı tek JSON olarak indir. <b>Şifreleme anahtarı (DNS_LOG_KEY) yedeğe DAHİL DEĞİL.</b>"
msgstr "Download all settings + block/allow lists + ready lists + rewrites + schedules as one JSON. <b>The encryption key (DNS_LOG_KEY) is NOT included in the backup.</b>"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:85
msgid "JSON indir"
msgstr "Download JSON"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:91
msgid "Yedekten geri yükle"
msgstr "Restore from backup"

#: dashboard/templates/dashboard/settings.html:92
